## 🐳 Deploy com Docker

### Build da imagem
```bash
docker build -t voluntarios-backend .
```

### Execução
```bash
docker run -d -p 8080:8080 --restart always voluntarios-backend
```

### Docker Compose
```bash
docker compose up -d
```

